  "descriptionHtml": "<p>Some prints stay home. Zebra is not one of them. Our Carter cargo backpack brings jacquard pattern energy to your commute, with flap and slip pockets outside so nothing gets buried. Gold-tone hardware keeps it polished. It's a backpack that pulls its weight and turns a head or two on the way.</p>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n<h4 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">Specifications & Details</h4>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<li><strong>Hardware:</strong> Gold hardware</li>\n<li><strong>Lining:</strong> Lining: fabric</li>\n<li><strong>Handle Drop:</strong> Handle drop: 3.5&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>Shoulder Strap Drop:</strong> Adjustable shoulder straps with 37&quot; drop at longest</li>\n<li><strong>Pockets:</strong> Interior: 2 slip pockets</li>\n<li><strong>Closure:</strong> Zip closure</li>\n<li><strong>Bag Dimensions:</strong> 9.72&quot; (L) x 13&quot; (H) x 5.75&quot; (W)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
